{"title": "Triune Netherstone", "pageid": 14469, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Triune_Netherstone", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Triune_Netherstone_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Triune_Netherstone_Icon.png/300px-Triune_Netherstone_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/c/cb/Triune_Netherstone_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Triune Netherstone image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Triune_Netherstone_Icon.png/300px-Triune_Netherstone_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Triune_Netherstone_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Triune Netherstone</span></a> is a quest item obtained at the end of <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n\nWith all three stones combined, you can now cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karsus%27_Compulsion\" title=\"Karsus' Compulsion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/38px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/50px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsus' Compulsion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karsus%27_Compulsion\" title=\"Karsus' Compulsion\">Karsus' Compulsion</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Fused in a macabre and powerful union, three <a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherstone\">netherstones</a> reflect the triarchy of the Dead Three: <a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\">Myrkul</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a>. As in geometrics, the triangular shape proves more stable than any linear or other structure, and the wearer of this <a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\">crown</a> feels - exquisite and tenebrous - the will to dominate flowing through them.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><so